Comment:
 This package ships the ported legacy helper, the gksu/dialog launcher and
 the Qt3 GUI (boot-repair-legacy-gui). The GUI links Qt 3.3.x, which is
 distributed under the GPL-2; the linked binary therefore carries the Qt3
 GPL-2 notice. The helper and launcher are plain shell and keep the project
 MIT license. The legacy artifact is experimental and separate from the
 modern Qt6 boot-repair package.
